sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor M as Authorized Safety Manager
    participant App as Application
    participant MH as MonitoringHandler
    participant AC as AccessControl
    participant CW as CameraWorker
    participant Det as Detector
    participant RD as RiskDetector
    participant DNG as DetNG
    participant ST as STGNN
    participant MAC as MotionAnomalyCalibrator
    participant KF as KalmanFilter

    M->>App: Open live monitor
    App->>MH: Request camera stream and status
    MH->>AC: Check live-monitor permission
    alt Authorized
        MH->>CW: Subscribe to frames and status
        loop For each processed camera frame
            CW->>Det: Detect, track, and build feature vectors
            Det-->>CW: Detections, track IDs, vectors
            CW->>RD: Assess current vectors and history
            par Deterministic assessment
                RD->>DNG: Evaluate safety rules
                DNG-->>RD: Rule score and violations
            and Learned assessment
                alt Aligned history and prior forecast available
                    RD->>ST: Score prior forecast against current observations
                    ST->>MAC: Calibrate forecast errors
                    MAC-->>ST: Anomaly score
                    ST-->>RD: Learned risk score
                else Insufficient history or tracking
                    Note over RD: Learned risk is unavailable, not zero
                end
            end
            alt Learned score available
                RD->>KF: Fuse learned score and rule score
                KF-->>RD: Fused risk estimate
            else Learned score unavailable
                Note over RD: Define whether to show rule-only risk or no fused score
            end
            RD-->>CW: Scores, violations, and availability status
            MH-->>App: Stream annotated frames and latest status
        end
    else Not authorized
        MH-->>App: Access Denied
    end
